@startuml
title lsw test.exe 时序
actor User
participant "lsw" as CLI
participant "lswd" as Daemon
participant "ssh" as SSH
participant "PowerShell" as PS

User -> CLI : lsw test.exe arg1 arg2
CLI -> CLI : 相对路径解析为绝对路径
alt 位于 $HOME 下
  CLI -> CLI : 映射为 Z:\\...
else 位于 $HOME 外
  CLI -> CLI : 复制到 $HOME/.lsw/tmp/<hash>/
  CLI -> CLI : 映射为 Z:\\...
end
CLI -> Daemon : exec { argv, cwd }
Daemon -> SSH : ssh -p 2222 "$WINDOWS_USER"@127.0.0.1 "& 'Z:\\...\\test.exe' ...; exit $LASTEXITCODE"
SSH -> PS : 执行程序
PS --> Daemon : stdout / stderr / exit code
Daemon --> CLI : { stdout, stderr, exit_code }
CLI --> User : 透传输出与退出码（0/5/6/7）
@enduml
